    description: "CSI (Container Storage Interface) Go implementations use a different code\ngeneration pattern than standard gRPC (no UnimplementedXxxServer embedding)\nand ttrpc (no RegisterXxxService). The current gRPC linker detects both of\nthose patterns but misses CSI-style implementations.\n\nDiscovered during kata-containers bakeoff analysis (PR #2176 discussion).\nNeeds investigation of what pattern CSI codegen actually produces, then\nextension of the gRPC linker to match it."  # dc56
